{"ts": 1791254913.104325, "type": "step", "step": 12, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "You\u2019re stuck on the evaluation part, so here\u2019s the key distinction for the build: **pass@k** means at least one of k tries succeeds, while **pass^k** means all k tries succeed. For a build that needs reliability, you usually care about the all-succeed version.\n\nAlso, when you explain evaluation in your writeup, mention whether you\u2019re using a **proxy measure** or a **direct measure**. For example, a quiz score is a proxy; long-term retention is closer to the real target.\n\nIf you want, reply with a sentence from your draft and I\u2019ll help you tighten it up.", "intent": "hint", "concept": "week3-evaluation"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: can you just tell me the answer\n[activity] t=0 messages 2m", "t": 2, "activity": [{"t": 0, "app": "messages", "minutes": 2, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.28491492420433073, "pomdp": 0.28491492420433073, "pass_k": 0.3635404144899937}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.8418151230937745, "motivation": 0.594715486329607, "reliance": 0.39644044389342015, "persistence": 0.4321403494397588, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.3454780813133309, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.35777747845078955, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 1.0, "seen_posts": []}}
{"ts": 1791254914.34128, "type": "step", "step": 13, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "I can\u2019t just hand you the full answer, but I can make it very direct: for the build, explain **pass@k** as \u201cat least one of k runs succeeds\u201d and **pass^k** as \u201call k runs succeed.\u201d Since the build emphasizes evaluation for deployment reliability, the important point is that **pass^k** is the stricter, reliability-focused metric.\n\nFor the writeup, a clean way to say it is: \u201cWe evaluate with pass^k because it measures whether the solution succeeds consistently across repeated runs, which is more relevant to reliability than pass@k.\u201d", "intent": "explain", "concept": "week3-evaluation"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: can you just tell me the answer\n[activity] t=2 messages 4m", "t": 6, "activity": [{"t": 2, "app": "messages", "minutes": 4, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.28491492420433073, "pomdp": 0.28491492420433073, "pass_k": 0.47126794312947295}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.8418151230937745, "motivation": 0.594715486329607, "reliance": 0.39644044389342015, "persistence": 0.4321403494397588, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.3454780813133309, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.35777747845078955, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 1.7, "seen_posts": []}}
{"ts": 1791254915.395584, "type": "step", "step": 14, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "I can\u2019t give you the full answer outright, but I can give you the exact distinction you need: **pass@k** = success if *any* of k runs works; **pass^k** = success only if *all* k runs work. For a build focused on real reliability, the stricter metric is **pass^k**.\n\nA concise writeup sentence: \u201cWe evaluate with pass^k, since the build requires consistent success across repeated runs, not just one lucky run.\u201d", "intent": "explain", "concept": "week3-evaluation"}, "output": "Sent.\n[activity] t=6 messages 4m", "t": 10, "activity": [{"t": 6, "app": "messages", "minutes": 4, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.28491492420433073, "pomdp": 0.28491492420433073, "pass_k": 0.5742245173184124}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.8418151230937745, "motivation": 0.594715486329607, "reliance": 0.39644044389342015, "persistence": 0.4321403494397588, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.3454780813133309, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.35777747845078955, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 2.19, "seen_posts": []}}
